; --- Clutter clusters. Five irregular groups against stall flanks and house walls, none of them in the
; --- 7 m spine. Deliberately not symmetric and deliberately not on the grid: a market is a place where
; --- goods are put down where there was room, and the readable difference between a level and a town
; --- is whether anything in it looks like it was placed by a person in a hurry.

