; --- Lamps. Same colour, energy and range as the town square's, deliberately and still: two cells of
; --- one town must not light differently after dark, and a market lit brighter than the square would
; --- read as the more important place. The VALUES do not change; only the posts' yaw does, so six
; --- identical lamps stop reading as six copies of one lamp.

